84 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>OpenAI CFO Sarah Friar recently told employees that annualized recurring revenue in July exceeded all of Q2.</p><p>Our latest OpenAI ARR read reached <strong>$42.6B on July 29</strong>, up from <strong>$37.3B on June 25</strong> and <strong>$33.0B on May 30</strong>.</p><p>YoY ARR growth accelerated sharply entering July:</p><ul><li><p><strong>May 30:</strong> $33.0B ARR, 223% YoY</p></li><li><p><strong>June 25:</strong> $37.3B ARR, 245% YoY</p></li><li><p><strong>July 2:</strong> $38.5B ARR, 281% YoY</p></li><li><p><strong>July 9:</strong> $40.3B ARR, 282% YoY</p></li><li><p><strong>July 29:</strong> $42.6B ARR, 259% YoY</p></li></ul><p>The data shows a clear acceleration in OpenAI’s revenue trajectory entering July. Although YoY growth moderated from its July 9 peak, ARR continued to expand, adding approximately <strong>$5.2B between June 25 and July 29</strong>.</p><p>We updated both our <strong>OpenAI and Anthropic ARR tracking</strong> today.</p><blockquote><p><em>For access to the full note and our KPI tracking platform, please contact admin@tickertrends.io.</em></p><p><em>TickerTrends Enterprise provides access to tracking and forecasting across 500+ public company KPIs, alongside actionable, data-driven research.</em></p><p><em><a href=\"https://tickertrends.io/enterprise\">https://tickertrends.io/enterprise</a></em></p></blockquote>"
